WEBVTT

00:00.320 --> 00:05.000
In reply to Father: the order was given by your son. Chu Huan merely followed my command!

00:05.160 --> 00:11.500
What do you mean you gave the order?! Let me tell you: this was Chu Huan's own treasonous scheme! Do you understand?!

00:11.500 --> 00:18.000
Yet that is not the truth! I beseech Father: spare his life!
